    Art1 --> FIR
    Art6 -->|Mandates BASA Agreements| AOC
    Art5 -->|Transit Notice| Charter
    Art12 -->|Over High Seas| ANSP
    Assembly & Council --> ANC --> Annexes
    Annexes -->|Not Directly Applicable Law| NAA
    NAA -->|Enacts Primary Aviation Law| AIP
    Art38 -->|Differences Notified to ICAO| AIP
    USOAP -.->|Audits National Compliance| NAA
    FIR --> Overflight --> ANSP
    NAA -->|Issues AOC & Licenses| AOC
